OL,3,GNEWSAPolice bid to trace man after flat
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are looking to find a man seen
OL,7,Frunning away after a fire in a flat in
OL,8,FDerby.
OL,10,FFirefighters were called to reports of
OL,11,Fthe fire on Osmaston Road, Normanton,
OL,12,Fat around 13:40 BST on Thursday.
OL,14,FAn investigation concluded the most
OL,15,Flikely cause was "accidental" and
OL,16,Flinked to the "inappropriate use of
OL,17,Felectrics in the roof space", but
OL,18,FDerbyshire Police said officers are
OL,19,Ftrying to identify an injured man seen
OL,20,Frunning across the road "with burns to
OL,21,Fhis face."
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
